title: "From Forecast Accuracy to Operational Value: Public Signal Augmentation for NYC 311 Service Demand"
abstract: "A predictive, correlational study of next-day NYC 311 reported request-volume forecasting using public calendar and NOAA weather signals, with a stylized forecast-to-decision staffing-allocation simulation."
